{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Buck converter · Ideal switches",
  "exampleId": "buck",
  "description": "24 V synchronous buck: a PWM generator at 10 kHz and 50 % duty drives two complementary ideal switches, a 1 mH / 100 µF filter and a 10 Ω load. Start from zero stored energy. Expect approximately 12 V and 1.2 A after settling. No losses, dead time, or parasitics: the switches have zero on-resistance and zero off-conductance. Change the duty cycle constant to move the output.",
